GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/orders?status=pending&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 65. Approve Multiple Sellers
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/sellers/pending
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 66. Process Multiple Withdrawals
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/withdrawals?status=pending&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

